        "translation": "If there is a close affinity, we can offer advice directly; if the affinity is slight, we can ask a virtuous person to speak for us. The Dharma will grow more complete and develop day by day if we know how to help one another overcome faults in this way. Of course, only love gives us the right to speak about a fellow practitioner’s faults. Without love, we lack the power to persuade and only add resentment and wounded pride.",
